# Glorious Decay, third mode: "Exile target card from a graveyard. Draw a card." Bot2's Ornithopter has died to Bot1's own
# first Decay (mode two) and sits in Bot2's graveyard; Bot1's second Decay exiles it, from the opponent's graveyard, and Bot1
# draws a card (an Island; the Swamp above it was the turn's draw). A target in either graveyard is legal: Bot1's own Glorious Decay could have
# been chosen as well. Bot1 draws exactly one card for the spell, and Decay itself is put into the graveyard after.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Glorious Decay
Glorious Decay
Forest
Swamp
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glorious Decay.Cast
Bot1.Modes(deals 4 damage)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glorious Decay.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Exile target card)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard =
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Island; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Glorious Decay; Glorious Decay
